lobal portfolio.","**Results season** — 252 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here."],"distress_risk":["**Radhagobind Commercial** -- Committee of Creditors approves the resolution plan by e-voting (04-11-2026 meeting), filed with NCLT Kolkata for sanction under IBC Sec 31.","**TeleCanor Global** -- receives a Section 7 IBC petition (Company Petition IB-156/7/HDB/2026); says it will contest it via an already-filed Writ Petition (WP 7800/2026).","**SKIL Infrastructure** -- its 15th CoC meeting (postponed from 9-Nov) concluded 11-Nov; no decision disclosed in the filing.","**NIS Management** -- ICRA upgrades its cash-credit facility to A-/Stable from BBB+/Positive and its short-term facility to A2+ from A2."],"open_offers":["**IIFL Capital Services Limited** — FIH Mauritius Investments Ltd open offer — offer price not parsed from the PA; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 11,071 cr"],"credit_rating_changes":["**NIS Management** -- ICRA upgrades its cash-credit facility to A-/Stable from BBB+/Positive and its short-term facility to A2+ from A2.","**Aye Finance Ltd** — Intimation for upgradation in Credit Rating of the Company under SEBI (Listing Obligations & Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”)"],"other_notable":["**Cupid** -- converts up to 56,00,000 of its own holding of Baazar Style Retail Ltd warrants into equity shares, increasing its stake in Baazar Style Retail.","Shareholding disclosure: open-market share purchases by Promoter/Promoter Group members of **Awfis Space Solutions**."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","open_of